          "role": "ROUTE_LEG",
          "sourceStart": 9409,
          "sourceEnd": 9431
        }
      ],
      "reason": "Describes walking along Darsena Sur and Av. Int. Hernan Giralt."
    },
    {
      "text": "If you are hungry at this point I can recommend:  - 🌭 Salad: eat *a choripan* in some of the kiosk over  Av. Int. Hernan Giralt.",
      "atomId": "a-074",
      "classification": "ALTERNATIVE",
      "entities": [
        {
          "sourceName": "Av. Int. Hernan Giralt",
          "supportSpan": "Av. Int. Hernan Giralt",
          "role": "ALTERNATIVE",
          "sourceStart": 9578,
          "sourceEnd": 9600
        }
      ],
      "reason": "Recommends a food stop along the avenue."
    },
    {
      "text": "**20hs - Return home / hotel**    If you return through the marked path, you can see the \"Centro Cultural Kirchner\" that used to be our old Central Post Office.",
      "atomId": "a-075",
      "classification": "TRANSFER",
      "entities": [
        {
